      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "If you haven&rsquo;t chosen how to bill Copilot code review for members with a Copilot license, those reviews will be billed to your organization starting December 30, 2026.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-25-copilot-code-review-billing-will-default-to-the-organization",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-25T22:18:03.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-26T19:33:57.615Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "This change applies to organizations and enterprises with Copilot Business or Copilot Enterprise.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-25-copilot-code-review-billing-will-default-to-the-organization",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-25T22:18:03.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-26T19:33:57.615Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Today, when no billing choice is saved, reviews by members who have a paid Copilot license use the member&rsquo;s Copilot entitlement.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-25-copilot-code-review-billing-will-default-to-the-organization",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-25T22:18:03.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-26T19:33:57.615Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Starting December 30, 2026, those reviews will be billed to the organization that owns the repository.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-25-copilot-code-review-billing-will-default-to-the-organization",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-25T22:18:03.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-26T19:33:57.615Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Accounts that don&rsquo;t have AI Credits paid usage enabled, have a billing lock, or have no billable customer will be set to Member instead.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-25-copilot-code-review-billing-will-default-to-the-organization",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-25T22:18:03.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-26T19:33:57.615Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "To keep using members&rsquo; Copilot entitlements, select Member in your enterprise or organization Copilot policy settings.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-25-copilot-code-review-billing-will-default-to-the-organization",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-25T22:18:03.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-26T19:33:57.615Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Organization billing requires AI Credits paid usage and can increase your organization&rsquo;s spending.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-25-copilot-code-review-billing-will-default-to-the-organization",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-25T22:18:03.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-26T19:33:57.615Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "To learn more, see Configuring code review by GitHub Copilot .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-25-copilot-code-review-billing-will-default-to-the-organization",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-25T22:18:03.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-26T19:33:57.615Z"
      },
      {
